Chilling stuff, literally, in this case. Thanks, {meteorologist}.
And there it is, folks: the one part of this broadcast we can actually prove.
Thanks, {meteorologist}. Somebody get that man a window that isn't cracked.
Wonderful. The sky's against us too. Thank you, {meteorologist}, sincerely.
