RAPTOR NEWS NETWORK, signing off. Stay tuned for static, then dread, then us again.
You have been watching Raptor News, and Raptor News has been watching you back. Rest well.
Raptor News is now going dark, as is the neighborhood. Coincidence? We report. You comply.
This broadcast has ended. Its effects on your blood pressure are permanent and non-refundable.
Raptor News: fair, balanced, and legally distinct from the truth. Until tomorrow, Coldwater Basin.
That's the transmission. Raptor News, the last light on the dial, and it is a warning light.
RAPTOR NEWS. We told you so, we're telling you so, and we'll tell you so again. Good night.
This concludes Raptor News. The fear you feel is normal, expected, and, per our sponsors, sponsored.
You've been watching Raptor News. Now go check on your neighbors. Report anything unusual. Especially the neighbors.
This has been Raptor News. Everything we said was true at the time we said it.
RAPTOR NEWS NETWORK. Broadcasting to the Basin nightly, and to whoever else is listening. We know you are.
That's the end of the transmission. Raptor News: first with the fear, last with the correction.
This has been Raptor News. Tell a friend. Tell an enemy. Tell the ratings board.
Raptor News, off the air. The city continues without us, unfortunately for the city.
